            <ArticleTitle>Endometriosis-induced acute small and large bowel obstruction: rare clinical entities.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>U1521</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The extragonadal manifestations of intestinal endometriosis necessitating immediate abdominal surgical exploration are, to date, sparsely represented within the literature. We present two cases of acute complete small and large bowel obstruction secondary to endometriosis, requiring emergent laparotomy; and review the pertinent literature.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
